WEBVTT

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:54.320
Last time on Dragon Ball Z, the Misfit Cavalry arrived.

00:01:54.320 --> 00:01:57.280
Leaping from their bedazzled pink helicopter,

00:01:57.280 --> 00:02:00.000
Mr. Satan's top two students entered the cell gate

00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:01.660
to fight in their master's place.

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:05.500
First came the graceful and self-proclaimed ladies' man, Karoni.

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:08.000
He launched into the air with his signature

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:09.820
Beautiful Flying Rose attack.

00:02:10.340 --> 00:02:12.420
And with a little boost from Cell's energy,

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:14.960
it was indeed a finishing move.

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:27.240
For Karoni was muscle man, Paroshki,

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:30.000
who charged Cell with his prize move

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:32.280
The Megaton Bowl Crusher!

00:02:32.280 --> 00:02:40.830
But without lifting a finger, Cell bowled over the bulbous fighter with a mere exertion of his energy.

00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:45.390
That's two for Cell, none for planet Earth.

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:52.040
Annoyed by his student slip-ups, Mr. Satan stepped in to settle the score.

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:56.040
It was time for the World Champion of Martial Arts to show his stuff.

00:02:56.040 --> 00:02:59.860
Ha! Ha! Ha! Ha!

00:03:10.780 --> 00:03:16.060
Mr. Satan's mouth finally shut, Cell could actually begin the tournament he'd intended.

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:20.270
Who will be first?

00:03:20.270 --> 00:03:22.270
Will it be Goku?

00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:24.480
Start things off.

00:03:24.480 --> 00:03:29.830
Goku, who had been anxiously waiting for his chance to square off with Cell.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:37.740
only one thing to say let's do it at last the main event has come in one

00:03:37.740 --> 00:03:42.600
corner of a biological Android created only to destroy and in the other the

00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:47.510
greatest hero the earth has ever known the fight begins today

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:49.200
L-ladies and gentlemen, our last hope rested upon the shoulders of Mr. Satan.

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:54.070
But now that he's lost, does this mean we're all doomed?

00:04:54.070 --> 00:04:56.790
This should be good.

00:04:56.790 --> 00:04:58.040
Yeah.

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:13.670
All right, Kakarot. It's time to see what you can do.

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:39.160
As I'm sure you know by now, I've been waiting for this.

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:43.520
Killing the helpless quickly grows old.

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:48.600
I'm counting on you for amusement when I test my body.

00:05:48.600 --> 00:05:53.400
I hear you're designed to use all of our techniques against us.

00:05:53.400 --> 00:05:55.320
Perfection.

00:06:01.660 --> 00:06:06.530
Hmm? Mr. Satan?

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:12.110
May I ask what happened with you there in the ring?

00:06:12.710 --> 00:06:15.650
Hey, it's no big deal. I just lost my footing.

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:18.850
