00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:27.840
Sure, it looked that way to an untrained eye.

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:30.000
But you're forgetting Hercule's strength.

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:38.220
I mean, when your big b*tals can make tinfoil chorebust the s--

00:06:38.220 --> 00:06:40.430
Huh, is that a fact?

00:06:40.430 --> 00:06:42.840
It is fact!

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:44.810
Okay...

00:06:44.810 --> 00:06:52.570
Don't worry, once I take a short break to relace my boots, I'll get back in there and squash that wimp!

00:06:52.570 --> 00:06:55.070
Now who rules?

00:06:55.070 --> 00:07:00.000
Mr. Satan! Mr. Satan!

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:03.650
That ridiculous man hasn't realized his weakness.

00:07:03.650 --> 00:07:06.410
His stupidity is beyond belief.

00:07:20.280 --> 00:07:21.570
So this is it.

00:07:21.570 --> 00:07:24.640
Now we'll see why Goku's been acting so confident all this time.

00:07:37.800 --> 00:07:41.940
folks if you're just tuning in there's great news

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:46.660
just moments ago mr satan confided in me he simply lost his footing in the

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:49.340
ring so once he ties his shoes he'll be back

00:07:49.340 --> 00:07:52.880
for more in the meantime we might as well get

00:07:52.880 --> 00:07:56.810
another preliminary bout over with this time cells challenger will be that

00:07:56.810 --> 00:08:00.000
cocky guy with the big hair but don't go too far away from your

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:08.170
In my professional opinion, this could get pretty ugly for the guy.

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:10.770
Hercule, any comments on the fight?

00:08:11.270 --> 00:08:13.250
Or maybe some advice for the challenger?

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:21.580
Just by looking at the runt, all I gotta say is you better have a stretcher and an ambulance standing by.

00:08:22.370 --> 00:08:23.910
Goku is just awesome.

00:08:24.660 --> 00:08:26.920
His form, it's flawless.

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:29.510
Just look at him.

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:34.000
He's standing right in front of a cell like it's just another day at the beach.

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:44.220
Yeah, it would almost appear like he's enjoying the moment.

00:08:44.220 --> 00:08:50.290
With all this new control as a Super Saiyan, he's by far the best chance this planet has.

00:09:12.380 --> 00:09:17.070
If I were fighting that twerp, I'd bend him into a pretzel and eat him for lunch.

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:20.570
But, lucky for him, I'm on a strict diet.

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:23.480
Enough joking.

00:09:23.780 --> 00:09:25.020
Here's my prediction.

00:09:25.650 --> 00:09:28.490
In five seconds, that kid's gonna be history.

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:30.000
Ha ha ha.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:33.260
- I sure hope he's got a health plan.

00:09:33.260 --> 00:09:35.500
