00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:41.460
- Ding.

00:10:32.840 --> 00:10:45.960
Their strength appears to be equal.

00:10:45.960 --> 00:10:54.060
And so far, it looks like neither of them are even short of breath.

00:10:54.060 --> 00:10:57.800
